kind: graph
dir: down
title: From a differing program to the pass
node a "program differs" fill=a
node b "one module\nllrm-c -S: listing, is the\ncode wrong?" fill=b
node c "the function\n--dump DIR: MIR after each pass,\nfirst wrong dump\nISEL_DUMP=1: LIR after each\nmachine phase" fill=b
node d "the pass or phase\nreduce, fixture,\ntest that fails first" fill=c
edge a -> b "swap one module at a time between\nthe reference build and llrm's"
edge b -> c "stop at the first bad write\nor jump (dosrun)"
edge c -> d
